# roadmap Phase 6 (and 4.3 for SE): operator_settings.lua "Expanded rosters (SE)" answers
# adjustment 29 (ADJROSTER) with 0, which SE 5.02's team select takes as "every team's extra
# players open". roster_probe.lua presses turbo on team select for six cursor positions:
# without the setting every team stops at pair 5; with it teams 21 and 24 reach pair 11 and
# team 22 pair 19 (team 20 has no more players). The patched GET_ADJ leaves A14 alone: SE's
# team select keeps the pair number there across the call (a first version that used A14
# broke exactly this). On T.E. the option does nothing.
script dist/NBAJamRecomp/mods/operator_settings.lua
extra roster_probe.lua
game nbajamse nbajamte
frames 5000
run se_rosters=-1
run se_rosters=0
se_rosters=-1: nolog pairs up to 11
se_rosters=-1: nolog adjustment
nbajamse: se_rosters=0: once se_rosters: 0 (adjustment 29)
nbajamse: se_rosters=0: once roster: team 21 pairs up to 11
nbajamse: se_rosters=0: once roster: team 24 pairs up to 11
nbajamse: se_rosters=0: log roster: team 22 pairs up to 19
nbajamte: se_rosters=0: nolog adjustment
nbajamte: se_rosters=0: nolog pairs up to 11
